  body:
    key: intro.body
    bold: 0
    smallCaps: 0
    fallback: 'Echoes of Vasteria has had a major update. Progression, tutorials and menus have changed, so some things may work differently from what you remember.


      I recommend starting a new save to experience the new introduction and progression. You can also choose to carry on with your existing save.


      Your hero moves between tasks, gathers resources and fights automatically during adventures. Start with <link="help:quests"><u><color=#EFB889>Quests</color></u></link> to meet the townsfolk and unlock new places to explore.


      You can ask for help on Discord.'
